stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Submitted: public form + Turnstile<br/>whistleblow-submit edge function

    Submitted --> UnderReview: triage<br/>RMD, CRO, ADMIN
    UnderReview --> Investigation: assign investigator
    UnderReview --> Dismissed: unfounded (reason required)
    Investigation --> Escalated: threshold or senior personnel
    Investigation --> Resolved: resolution_notes required
    Escalated --> Resolved
    Resolved --> Closed: after reporter acknowledgement window
    Dismissed --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Submitted
        Required: category, subject, description.
        Server-generated: case_reference,
        follow_up_token, reporter_passphrase_hash.
        Rate-limited per IP + fingerprint.
    end note

    note right of UnderReview
        Guard: caller holds RMD/CRO/ADMIN.
        Sets assigned_to, assigned_at, priority.
        Unassigned > 14 days -> flagged_unassigned.
    end note

    note right of Investigation
        Two-way messaging via whistleblow_messages.
        No activity > 60 days -> flagged_stagnant.
    end note

    note right of Resolved
        Guard: resolution_notes non-empty;
        resolved_at stamped. Summary is exposed
        to the reporter via follow-up portal.
    end note
